        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Can you feel my pain?\" I realized I'd never asked. \"I can't feel the pain itself, but I can feel you hurting.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2173
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Then this is hard on you too. I don't want it to be my call. You get to decide,\" I finally said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2285
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"The prisoners are all secured, and there's no rush to get the magic taken down. We're exactly where we need to be right",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4624
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"You know the rules. I don't drink from you while you're hungry or in pain.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5261
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "People could talk shit if they wanted to. Dante's fingers were intertwined with mine, and I was about to eat expensive r",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6459
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"You're the one who said there's no time limit. If I'm tired down there, we can come back tomorrow.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8133
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I didn't think I was falling in love with him, anymore. I was pretty sure I loved him. Maybe I should've been terrified ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9531
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
